            <ArticleTitle>N-Heterocyclic Carbene Catalyzed Stereoselective Glycosylation of 2-Nitrogalactals.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5272-5275</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.orglett.7b02543</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An efficient N-heterocyclic carbene catalyzed glycosylation of 2-nitrogalactals with alcohols and phenol has been developed for the first time. A wide variety of 1,2-cis-2-nitroglycosides can be obtained with good to excellent yields and high to excellent α-selectivities.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
